  "body": "Enjoy a secure, ultimate resort-style lifestyle just 30 minutes from Auckland CBD. Perfectly positioned beachside of St Heliers Bay and only a short stroll to the village, cafés and local amenities, this prestigious address offers an exceptional family lifestyle in one of Auckland's most sought-after seaside locations.\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed by Fairhead Sang Carnahan and constructed with solid concrete block, 5/7 Cliff Road presents a beautifully appointed four-bedroom apartment with house-like proportions, generous living spaces, and effortless everyday living, and an ideal solution for families with teenagers seeking room to grow, independence to explore, and a secure coastal lifestyle without compromise.\r\n\r\nDesigned with lifestyle in mind, the residence features three bathrooms, two substantial living areas, and an abundance of space for growing families to spread out and enjoy. The superb shared amenities create a lifestyle rarely found in apartment living, with direct access to the tennis court, swimming pool and games room. Whether it's after-school tennis matches, summer days spent by the pool, or a dedicated space for teenagers to entertain friends, the facilities provide endless opportunities for recreation and connection without ever leaving home.\r\n\r\nThe designer open-plan kitchen, living and dining areas form the heart of the home, flowing seamlessly to a generous sun-soaked deck that captures sweeping sea views stretching from Rangitoto Island to the Auckland Harbour Bridge. A second oversized balcony overlooks the heated pool, tennis court and beautifully maintained grounds, enhancing the sense of space, relaxation and resort-style living.\r\n\r\nThe oversized master suite offers a peaceful retreat, complete with a private third balcony, walk-in wardrobe and spacious ensuite. Elegant marble flooring flows from the entrance through the hallways and bathrooms, adding a refined touch throughout.\r\n\r\nWith lift access to secure basement parking, two car parks, storage units and premium resident amenities, this exceptional residence delivers the space of a family home with the convenience, security and lock-up-and-leave ease of apartment living, all moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nPhone for viewing times.",
